The witness guest for E3 (#1376, ADR 0140) — provenance, per ADR 0114's rule for committed guest binaries. Like
p3tcp, it is reproducible from this repository plus the pinned toolchain: p3udp/build.sh rebuilds it offline. It needs
no peer.

Source:       src/main.rs, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock (this directory). No dependencies and no WIT of its own: its
              imports are the ones Rust std and wasi-libc make for a wasm32-wasip3 program that uses UDP.
